# The Steam game (godot/game, 2026-09-30). Godot's per-machine import cache
# and class registry (regenerated on first open; committing it only makes
# conflicts between machines), GodotSteam's binaries (fetched by
# tools/setup.mjs, never committed) and export output.
game/.godot/
game/addons/godotsteam/
# Art copied from web/public by tools/setup.mjs (never committed twice).
game/art/
game/build/
*.tmp
# Written by godot/trailer/record.py while it records (a 1080p window); never kept.
game/override.cfg
